      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Very good race. YULE POINT (3) is 2/2 in Darwin for the new yard, beating many of these last time. Creeping up in the weights but at his top now and expected to go close again. HAMMURABI (1) was in great form over this sort of distance before stepping to the mile and into the Darwin Guineas. Was solid finishing fourth and is coming back in class and trip for this. Can immediately bounce back. SI SENORA (5) is another going well, the latest finishing runner-up behind YULE POINT. Meets the winner better at the weights and can be in the finish again. TEXTURE (6) is a former McEvoy galloper having first run in the NT and presents on the back of a second placing at Swan Hill latest. The figure more than measures up. VORONYA (2) was placed behind YULE POINT last time and will strip fitter.",
